import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 301 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Demon-Race Situation: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Myriad-Races Inequality","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 301 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Demon-Race Situation: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Myriad-Races Inequality","no":301,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Demon Race","Myriad-Races Inequality","Racial Discrimination","Oligarchic Civilization"],"related":["05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","52-Foreign-Race Classification and Symbiosis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0301_模块2-遮天-妖族处境.md","filePath":"en/0301_模块2-遮天-妖族处境.md"}'),o={name:"en/0301_模块2-遮天-妖族处境.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,d){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-301-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-demon-race-situation-shrouding-the-heavens-version-of-myriad-races-inequality" tabindex="-1">Entry 301 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Demon-Race Situation: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Myriad-Races Inequality <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-301-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-demon-race-situation-shrouding-the-heavens-version-of-myriad-races-inequality" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 301 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Demon-Race Situation: Shrouding-the-Heavens Version of Myriad-Races Inequality&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 14) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 50, 52</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-in-shrouding-the-heavens-world-the-demon-race-is-not-even-equal-citizen" tabindex="-1">Introduction: In Shrouding-the-Heavens world, the demon race is not even &quot;equal citizen&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-in-shrouding-the-heavens-world-the-demon-race-is-not-even-equal-citizen" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: In Shrouding-the-Heavens world, the demon race is not even &quot;equal citizen&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to have equal evolution qualification. This entry dissects the demon race&#39;s situation in Shrouding-the-Heavens world — as mounts, vassals, or crusade targets, never recognized as a co-governance subject equal to &quot;human cultivation circles.&quot; The law-first axiom reminds: racial inequality is not supporting-character setting, but structure written into the world-view. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Demon race marginalized energy waste:</p><ul><li>The demon race is innately physically strong, could have been an important civilization-building force, but is positioned as &quot;demon beast / mount / enemy&quot;</li><li>Demon geniuses excluded from mainstream lineages, massive talent wasted</li><li>Long-term human-demon enmity, cosmos-tier energy consumed in racial war rather than common development</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Racial inequality&#39;s regression consequences:</p><ol><li><strong>Civilization civil war</strong>: human-demon conflict periodically erupts, consuming civilization total</li><li><strong>Knowledge fragmentation</strong>: demon cultivation system runs parallel to human, no exchange, repeated trial-and-error</li><li><strong>Symbiosis potential stifled</strong>: Myriad Ranks could complement each other (e.g., demon physique + human Dao path), but wasted by prejudice</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s relationship with the demon race is a typical sample of Myriad-Race inequality:</p><ul><li><strong>Demon race as supporting cast</strong>: demon strong ones mostly appear as opponents, mounts, or tool characters, rarely with independent civilization lines</li><li><strong>Human perspective default</strong>: narrative from human standpoint, demon race&#39;s &quot;legitimate demands&quot; almost never taken seriously</li><li><strong>Might-is-right racial version</strong>: demon strong ones are either subjugated or destroyed, no &quot;co-govern with demon race&quot; option</li></ul><p>Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking here manifests: he defaults that humanity is the cosmos&#39; protagonist race, the demon race is only a functional presence in plot.</p><p>The demon race&#39;s situation also has a structural reason: Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; demon race is designed to &quot;human-shape-shift,&quot; which on the surface gives demons equal opportunity, actually rewards &quot;becoming human.&quot; The more demon-like a human, the higher status; the demon retaining its own form is treated as a beast. This is hidden racial assimilation logic — it does not directly eliminate the demon race, but induces the demon race to self-erase its nature. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad Races republicanism is precisely the opposite: it requires each race to retain its traits, develop its own path; humans need not become demons, demons need not become humans. True equality is not assimilation, but each appreciating its own beauty.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding&#39;s Demon-Race Situation</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Demon race as mount / vassal / enemy</td><td>Myriad Races republicanism, demon race as equal citizen</td></tr><tr><td>Human perspective monopolizes narrative</td><td>Myriad Races five genealogies each with complete path</td></tr><tr><td>Long-term human-demon enmity</td><td>Myriad Ranks co-build, racial complement</td></tr><tr><td>Demon geniuses wasted</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage, demon race has a road</td></tr><tr><td>No co-governance option</td><td>Anchor Council includes Myriad-Rank representatives</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Shrouding human-demon relationship structure and conflict frequency</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;demon race equal constitutionalized&quot; vs. &quot;maintain human-centered&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: racial war frequency, demon success rate, civilization total energy</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — after demon race equal, civilization total energy rises significantly, civil-war consumption drops sharply</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Demon-race strength and human relations adjust by plot need, sometimes strong, sometimes vulnerable</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Demon race&#39;s positioning in the trilogy is inconsistent early and late</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Ye Fan as human strong one, his stance is the narrative stance</li></ul><p>The demon race&#39;s situation also has a narratological consequence: because the demon race is marginalized, Shrouding-the-Heavens cosmos&#39; &quot;diversity&quot; is actually fake. On the surface countless races, actually narrative only cares about human strong ones&#39; contention; the demon race is just a backdrop. A cosmos truly inclusive of Myriad Ranks should let the demon race have its own epic, its own philosophy, its own civilization peak — not only &quot;some demon strong one as villain&quot; functional character. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad Races five genealogies, each with independent cultivation path and civilization history, this is true diversity.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: demon talent wasted, racial war internal friction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: defining the demon race as second-class citizen is evolution-rights predation at racial level</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo world at least universally benefits within humanity; Shrouding does not even recognize the demon race&#39;s basic qualification</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this entry is precisely the Myriad-Races axiom&#39;s direct range — the demon race must have a road</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: racially unequal cosmos cannot face true Myriad Ranks</li></ul><p>We must also see: the demon race&#39;s &quot;instrumentalization&quot; in Shrouding-the-Heavens manifests not only in battle, but in resource narrative. Demon-race territories are often described as &quot;rich mines,&quot; &quot;treasure lands,&quot; as if the demon race is just resource wrapping paper. This narrative degrades the demon race&#39;s homeland to a mine waiting to be mined, fundamentally negating demon-race civilization subjectivity. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad Races republicanism requires treating each race&#39;s homeland as its civilization&#39;s sovereignty; other races entering must negotiate through the Anchor Council, not &quot;discover = mine.&quot;</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The demon race&#39;s fate in Shrouding-the-Heavens world is the most common script when &quot;Myriad Races republicanism&quot; is missing — strong but marginalized, clever but instrumentalized. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s first rule: there is no &quot;protagonist race,&quot; only races that have not yet found their place.</p><p>The demon race&#39;s situation is the touchstone for whether a cosmos-tier novel truly has cosmic vision. Shrouding-the-Heavens fails this touchstone — however large its cosmos, it is humanity&#39;s backyard.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · demon-race situation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.html">Entry 302 · Human-Centered Critique</a> · <a href="./313_模块2-遮天-万族共和方案.html">Entry 313 · Myriad Races Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
